9
00:50:24,000 --> 00:50:30,000
Tom, played by Paul McGillion.

10
00:56:00,000 --> 00:56:06,000
Grandma, played by Elan Ross Gibson.

11
01:01:36,000 --> 01:01:42,000
A Castle for Christmas is a 2021 American Christmas romantic comedy film
directed by Mary Lambert, and starring Brooke Shields and Cary Elwes.

12
01:07:12,000 --> 01:07:18,000
Bestselling author Sophie Brown journeys to Scotland, both to avoid outrage towards her latest book and to find inspiration to write her
next one, but she unexpectedly falls in love with a castle – unexpectedly connecting  with its curmudgeonly duke owner.

13
01:12:48,000 --> 01:12:54,000
The film was released on November 26, 2021, by Netflix.

14
01:18:24,000 --> 01:18:30,000
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
